er the year.Nasdaq Composite Index is just a number that lets you track performance of the instruments comprising the index, so you can't invest in it directly. But you can buy Nasdaq Composite Index futures or funds or invest in its components.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770734203950}}
